  "description" : "Have you ever thought that under the neon-lit city, there are monsters from ancient myths? Have you ever thought that above the moon hanging high above the heads of the world, there are gods standing to watch over the world? Have you ever thought that in the surging modern city, there are extraordinary people who walk the world on behalf of gods? In the society ruled by humans, there are countless weird things; in those life forbidden areas that no one cares about, there live ancient gods. Seraph Michael, Hades, Poseidon... Where did the gods of Daxia go? In this world that belongs to \"people\", \"mystery\" needs to be cleared up!\nsource: movie.douban.com/googletranslate",
